1
00:01:27,440 --> 00:01:28,240
Stay away.

2
00:01:30,360 --> 00:01:33,360
I don't know when I'll lose my mind

3
00:01:34,560 --> 00:01:35,880
and hurt you.

4
00:01:39,240 --> 00:01:40,360
So you lied to me

5
00:01:40,479 --> 00:01:41,880
to trick me into leaving.

6
00:01:46,440 --> 00:01:48,100
The most urgent task right now

7
00:01:48,400 --> 00:01:49,759
is to find the Soul Jade.

8
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:51,800
As for other things...

9
00:01:51,800 --> 00:01:52,960
Don't worry, Miss Tang.

10
00:01:52,960 --> 00:01:54,280
I can imitate Jingxuan's handwriting

11
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:55,759
and it's 80 to 90 percent alike.

12
00:01:55,759 --> 00:01:57,520
For official documents and letters,

13
00:01:57,520 --> 00:01:59,120
there won't be any mistakes.

14
00:02:02,800 --> 00:02:03,400
Jingxuan.

15
00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:04,080
Jingxuan.

16
00:02:05,520 --> 00:02:07,120
Jingxuan, let go.

17
00:02:08,160 --> 00:02:09,090
Yuwen Jingxuan.

18
00:02:16,880 --> 00:02:17,480
Jingxuan.

19
00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:19,160
Jingxuan.

20
00:02:19,480 --> 00:02:20,320
Jingxuan.

21
00:02:20,640 --> 00:02:22,760
It's okay. It's okay.

22
00:02:23,640 --> 00:02:24,880
You'll be fine.

23
00:02:30,040 --> 00:02:30,840
I'm fine.

24
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:33,160
I'm fine.

25
00:02:45,160 --> 00:02:46,240
Miss Tang.

26
00:02:46,840 --> 00:02:48,160
Jingxuan's condition is getting worse.

27
00:02:48,160 --> 00:02:49,560
He is awake less and less.

28
00:02:50,160 --> 00:02:52,320
Do you have any other way?

29
00:02:53,160 --> 00:02:54,720
Things are too complicated right now.

30
00:02:54,720 --> 00:02:57,120
I can't explain it to you clearly at the moment.

31
00:02:57,120 --> 00:02:59,640
But only the Soul Jade can save him now.

32
00:03:01,560 --> 00:03:02,360
In that case,

33
00:03:02,720 --> 00:03:03,780
I'll think of a way.

34
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:05,960
Miss Tang.

35
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:08,450
Since Jingxuan wants you to leave,

36
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:10,050
you should temporarily...

37
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:12,160
Young Master Su.

38
00:03:12,320 --> 00:03:13,720
You asking me to leave

39
00:03:13,720 --> 00:03:14,980
is for righteousness.

40
00:03:15,120 --> 00:03:16,250
But my choice to stay

41
00:03:16,720 --> 00:03:17,400
is for love.

42
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:18,120
For love.

43
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:27,240
I think Young Master Su can understand.

44
00:04:06,440 --> 00:04:08,240
Is it because you were worried about me

45
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:09,560
that you came to see me?

46
00:04:14,160 --> 00:04:16,000
Do you still remember who I am?

47
00:04:22,200 --> 00:04:24,160
I am your fiancée.

48
00:04:27,280 --> 00:04:28,680
My wife.

49
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:41,200
Do you want to watch over me while I sleep?

50
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:54,240
Prince Shuo sometimes becomes ruthless

51
00:05:54,240 --> 00:05:56,080
and sometimes acts like a child.

52
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:59,280
Are you really going to keep taking care of him?

53
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:04,200
What are your plans next?

54
00:06:06,040 --> 00:06:07,900
Can Prince Shuo still get better?

55
00:06:11,520 --> 00:06:15,800
We have a saying in the Central Plains that human effort can achieve anything.

56
00:06:15,800 --> 00:06:17,080
That Soul Jade,

57
00:06:17,640 --> 00:06:19,240
what do you plan to do with it?

58
00:06:23,760 --> 00:06:24,840
I can help you.

59
00:06:26,280 --> 00:06:27,440
But I need your help

60
00:06:27,440 --> 00:06:29,600
to persuade Su Zhiye to let me go back.

61
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:31,160
I know

62
00:06:31,640 --> 00:06:34,360
that Young Master Su forcing you to stay by his side

63
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:35,360
is wrong.

64
00:06:36,040 --> 00:06:37,400
But as his friend...

65
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:39,000
I have no way

66
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:40,240
to make him let you go.

67
00:06:41,280 --> 00:06:43,159
Why won't even you help me?

68
00:06:44,440 --> 00:06:45,520
His Highness ran out

69
00:06:45,520 --> 00:06:47,520
and injured two guards in the manor.

70
00:06:51,960 --> 00:06:53,360
Come take a look, everyone.

71
00:06:53,360 --> 00:06:55,040
I have gem pendants

72
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:56,480
and peach wood combs here.

73
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:58,480
Come over and take a look, everyone.

74
00:06:58,480 --> 00:07:01,400
I have fine peach wood combs here.

75
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:03,920
Take a look, sir.

76
00:07:03,920 --> 00:07:06,680
There are peach wood combs and gem pendants here.

77
00:07:07,080 --> 00:07:08,440
And gem pendants.

78
00:07:08,760 --> 00:07:10,280
Take a look at the peach wood ones, sir.

79
00:07:10,280 --> 00:07:11,740
These are pure peach wood.

80
00:07:13,800 --> 00:07:15,000
Hey, you haven't paid yet.

81
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:17,240
If you don't pay, give me back my things.

82
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:18,680
Give me the money.

83
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:19,880
Pay up.

84
00:07:20,080 --> 00:07:20,720
You haven't paid.

85
00:07:20,720 --> 00:07:23,680
You can either give me the money or give me back my things.

86
00:07:23,680 --> 00:07:24,520
You didn't pay,

87
00:07:24,520 --> 00:07:25,800
and you just took the things and left.

88
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:26,560
What are you doing?

89
00:07:26,560 --> 00:07:27,480
Taking things without paying.

90
00:07:27,480 --> 00:07:28,720
Give me back my things.

91
00:07:28,720 --> 00:07:30,160
Either give me back my things,

92
00:07:30,160 --> 00:07:31,290
or give me the money.

93
00:07:31,520 --> 00:07:33,320
You can't just take it and leave.

94
00:07:33,640 --> 00:07:35,440
Why won't you give it back to me?

95
00:07:35,440 --> 00:07:36,240
Give it back.

96
00:07:36,560 --> 00:07:37,680
My lady, you don't know.

97
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:38,920
He took my things.

98
00:07:39,360 --> 00:07:41,360
He didn't pay and tried to run. Look.

99
00:07:42,880 --> 00:07:44,080
Give me the money. Give me the money.

100
00:07:44,080 --> 00:07:45,810
Sorry, please let him go first.

101
00:07:47,520 --> 00:07:49,040
Please accept this as an apology.

102
00:07:49,040 --> 00:07:51,040
Okay, thank you, my lady. Thank you.

103
00:07:52,640 --> 00:07:54,360
Okay, thank you.

104
00:07:54,520 --> 00:07:56,760
Jingxuan, it's okay now.

105
00:07:59,640 --> 00:08:00,640
For my wife.

106
00:08:01,440 --> 00:08:04,200
Is this for me?

107
00:08:06,920 --> 00:08:08,320
For my wife.

108
00:08:12,760 --> 00:08:13,960
For my wife.

109
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:23,040
Let's go home.

110
00:08:23,040 --> 00:08:25,040
This is also peach wood. Take a look.

111
00:08:28,200 --> 00:08:30,800
Peach wood combs, gemstone pendants!

112
00:08:31,920 --> 00:08:34,049
Peach wood combs, gemstone pendants!

113
00:08:55,800 --> 00:08:57,440
Thank you. I love it.

114
00:09:44,400 --> 00:09:45,200
Su Zhiye.

115
00:09:46,240 --> 00:09:47,970
I'm here to pick up Princess Yu.

116
00:09:48,040 --> 00:09:49,370
Why are you stopping me?

117
00:09:49,960 --> 00:09:50,760
What?

118
00:09:51,120 --> 00:09:52,780
Is this Prince Shuo's Mansion

119
00:09:53,760 --> 00:09:55,840
under your control now, Su Zhiye?

120
00:09:56,160 --> 00:10:00,040
Prince Shuo has caught a cold and is too unwell to see guests.

121
00:10:02,280 --> 00:10:04,480
Good thing it's just a common cold.

122
00:10:06,480 --> 00:10:09,000
It would be bad if he caught

123
00:10:10,320 --> 00:10:12,960
some other stubborn disease. Anyway.

124
00:10:14,360 --> 00:10:17,000
I'm just here today to take my princess back.

125
00:10:17,680 --> 00:10:20,840
Su Zhiye, go fetch my princess.

126
00:10:21,960 --> 00:10:24,000
I don't know where Princess Yu is.

127
00:10:27,120 --> 00:10:27,920
Su Zhiye.

128
00:10:29,200 --> 00:10:31,560
That came from Jingxuan's room, right?

129
00:10:32,160 --> 00:10:33,620
Aren't you going to check?

130
00:10:34,320 --> 00:10:35,160
My subordinates are clumsy.

131
00:10:35,160 --> 00:10:35,840
He has already left.

132
00:10:35,840 --> 00:10:36,480
It happens often.

133
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:38,040
It's fine. It's fine.

134
00:10:39,320 --> 00:10:41,780
I'm still worried about Jingxuan's safety.

135
00:10:50,320 --> 00:10:51,120
Su Zhiye.

136
00:10:52,320 --> 00:10:54,720
You stopped me from picking up my princess.

137
00:10:55,800 --> 00:10:57,160
I went to see Jingxuan,

138
00:10:57,160 --> 00:10:58,420
and you stopped me too.

139
00:11:04,120 --> 00:11:04,920
Su Zhiye.

140
00:11:09,200 --> 00:11:10,730
What is the meaning of this?

141
00:11:11,880 --> 00:11:13,040
I will go with you.

142
00:11:21,840 --> 00:11:22,640
Xiyao.

143
00:11:23,120 --> 00:11:24,080
I want to return to the mansion.

144
00:11:24,080 --> 00:11:25,610
Why do you keep stopping me?

145
00:11:28,440 --> 00:11:30,100
You finally came to pick me up.

146
00:11:30,600 --> 00:11:32,240
If you hadn't come to pick me up,

147
00:11:32,240 --> 00:11:34,840
I don't know how long this person would have kept me locked up.
